.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
See the module.
.PP
\fBChipGroup\fR: a wrapping set of toggle chips, optionally filtered by a find\-as\-you\-type entry. \fBMultiSelect\fR is a dropdown; this is the in\-page version, for tags, genres, moods and filters.
.PP
The application owns the selection (controlled) and the query. Each option has a key, a label and optionally an icon and a color of its own; the chips are \fBChip\fRs, so \fBsize\fR and \fBon_color\fR apply to all.
.PP
.nf
.RS
ChipGroup::new(
    tags.iter().map(|t| ChipOption::new(t.id, &t.name).color(t.color)),
    &self.selected,
    Msg::Toggle,                                   // gets the key of the pressed chip
)
\&.search(&self.query, Msg::Query)                  // an entry above filters by label
.RE
.fi
